    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "反序列化折返",
      "items": [
        "DefaultJSONParser.parse(Type) 从 config.getDeserializer(type) 取反序列化器，JavaBeanDeserializer 特判后直接 deserialze",
        "字段值可能递归回到 JSON.parseObject；@type 引用先记 ResolveTask，最后 handleResovleTask 统一解析"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "序列化折返",
      "items": [
        "JSON.toJSONString 建 SerializeWriter 与 JSONSerializer，write(object) 按运行期 Class 取 ObjectSerializer 再回调 write",
        "SerializeConfig 缓存 writer；默认 asm=true 时用 ASMSerializerFactory 生成 JavaBeanSerializer 子类，关闭后走反射"
      ]
    }
  ]
